        "heading": "Why Choose The Klawford Rugby Divan Bed?"
      },
      "blocks": {
        "f1": {
          "type": "feature",
          "settings": {
            "title": "60 Night Risk-Free Trial",
            "description": "<p>Sleep on your new Rugby Divan Bed for up to 60 nights completely risk-free. If you're not fully satisfied with your purchase for any reason, contact our team and we'll arrange a full refund or a free replacement — no arguments, no hassle, just great sleep guaranteed.</p>",
            "image_src": "https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0960/5588/6153/files/image_6.jpg"
          }
        },
        "f2": {
          "type": "feature",
          "settings": {
            "title": "Extra Storage Built In",
            "description": "<p>Maximise your bedroom space with the Rugby Divan Bed's optional smooth-glide storage drawers. Choose from 2 or 4 drawers built directly into the base — perfect for bedding, pillows, and seasonal items you want close at hand but neatly out of sight.</p>",
            "image_src": "https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0960/5588/6153/files/image_6.jpg"
          }
        },
        "f3": {
          "type": "feature",
          "settings": {
            "title": "Sustainably Sourced & UK Handmade",
            "description": "<p>Every Klawford Rugby Divan Bed is handcrafted in the United Kingdom using responsibly sourced timber and premium upholstery fabrics. We're committed to reducing our environmental footprint while delivering a product built to last a lifetime — because great furniture and sustainability go hand in hand.</p>",
            "image_src": "https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0960/5588/6153/files/image_2.jpg"
          }
        },
        "f4": {
          "type": "feature",
          "settings": {
            "title": "Customisable Headboards",
            "description": "<p>Make it truly yours. The Rugby Divan Bed comes with a fully upholstered headboard in your choice of fabric and colour — Black, Grey, Cream, Red, or Brown. Whether you prefer a sleek panel design or a wingback silhouette, the headboard arrives pre-assembled and ready to attach in minutes.</p>",
            "image_src": "https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0960/5588/6153/files/image_6.jpg"
          }
        },
        "f5": {
          "type": "feature",
          "settings": {
            "title": "Compatible With Any Mattress",
            "description": "<p>The Rugby Divan Base works beautifully with any mattress type — memory foam, pocket sprung, hybrid, or orthopaedic. Pair it with the Klawford Hybrid 3000 for a luxury hotel feel, or the Klawford Duo Sleep for couples with different firmness preferences. The solid platform top gives even support no matter what you choose.</p>",
            "image_src": "https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0960/5588/6153/files/image_2.jpg"
          }
        }
      },
      "block_order": ["f1","f2","f3","f4","f5"]
    },
